{
  "content": {
    "arguments": "$ARGUMENTS",
    "constraints": [
      {
        "id": "6a22dafc-1418-4bc3-8c16-d0a6e976e443",
        "text": "Use the Bash tool. The Pebbles CLI at \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" is the ONLY sanctioned way to change spec files — never edit .pebble files directly."
      },
      {
        "id": "775c719d-efd3-4b3b-bad3-b459f618238f",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Spec mutation contract (rules/system/spec-mutation-contract)"
      },
      {
        "id": "c0531aa5-cbd9-4529-b3d5-2d1f081802d3",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Reference integrity (rules/system/reference-integrity)"
      },
      {
        "id": "637e06f2-cefd-4dda-b979-323beec6c689",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Graph-first navigation (rules/system/graph-first-navigation)"
      },
      {
        "id": "7e3b021b-bcd5-42f9-962c-dea57b3e6eaf",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Analysis standard (rules/system/analysis-standard)"
      }
    ],
    "examples": [],
    "kind": "skill",
    "onFailure": [
      {
        "id": "333f622d-8075-479b-8363-38e34d94cbaf",
        "text": "Read the CLI error — it names the fix; correct the call and retry once"
      },
      {
        "id": "666b10b1-37a4-493b-8da9-11faf2c86744",
        "text": "NEVER fall back to editing .pebble files directly, whatever failed"
      },
      {
        "id": "df3fb054-02d4-4ed0-811a-dea3ebf7eb8e",
        "text": "If still blocked, report the exact command and error to the user and stop"
      }
    ],
    "output": "A prioritized table of gaps — nothing is fixed by this skill.",
    "prerequisites": [
      {
        "id": "83df8ce5-9696-4526-84fb-ee582b40b15d",
        "text": "A saved map — its hubs drive the code-side gap"
      }
    ],
    "purpose": "Gap analysis: spec without code, code without spec",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "313c5aea-ebd1-43e3-8c69-39b8cc665ccb",
        "text": "Coverage report — the gaps in BOTH directions: $ARGUMENTS"
      },
      {
        "id": "3a68dcae-4045-414d-b9c8-852456521026",
        "text": "PREFLIGHT: a saved map (its hubs drive the code-side gap)."
      },
      {
        "id": "9571c04e-dc01-482c-b6de-f9c0ee10dbb3",
        "text": "Find THREE gaps: (1) SPEC WITHOUT CODE — `query` pebbles (models/structures/apis/workflows/requirements) lacking codeLinks: the spec claims what the graph can't point to. (2) CODE WITHOUT SPEC — the map's hubs (most-imported files) with no pebble referencing them: core code nobody specified. (3) REQUIREMENTS WITHOUT TESTS — requirement pebbles with no tests/ pebble ref."
      },
      {
        "id": "4077f376-78b7-4d2a-9bb2-8c8b4cd3ff1b",
        "text": "Fix NOTHING here. Record the totals so coverage is comparable over time: \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" add-finding <most-relevant-pebble> --title \"Coverage: ...\" --category measurement --body \"## Observation\\n\\nspec-without-code N, code-without-spec M, requirements-without-tests K\\n\\n## Evidence\\n\\n- ...\"."
      },
      {
        "id": "00f7d50c-fe88-446a-a435-ba28d09c0be6",
        "text": "Report: a prioritized table of gaps, worst first."
      }
    ],
    "verify": [
      {
        "id": "b92244f3-2307-40ac-aec0-7789d3b3dc02",
        "text": "The gap table is recorded as a finding (--category measurement) so coverage is comparable over time"
      }
    ],
    "whenToUse": "Gap analysis in both directions: spec without code, code (hubs) without spec, requirements without tests."
  },
  "createdAt": "2026-07-21T14:32:38.766Z",
  "description": "Gap analysis: spec without code, code without spec",
